{
  "_comment": [
    "Primitives TestServer commons server-config.json (design 'Server Configuration'):",
    "product + one Configuration_Entry per language. The Feature_Catalog lives in the",
    "sibling feature-set.json and the bug ledger in bug-list.json (the doc's",
    "three-file layout) — the only supported configuration format. The shared",
    "orchestrator (test-server-common/orchestrator/) loads this trio and resolves",
    "each entry's server from its Server_Location.",
    "",
    "The Dafny-runtime Language_Servers (java, net, python, go, rust-dafny) live in",
    "aws-cryptographic-material-providers-library under test-server/<lang>-v<major>-server/.",
    "The Rust Language_Server lives in aws-crypto-tools-rust under prim-test-server/;",
    "configPath names the DIRECTORY holding its per-server trio",
    "(server-config.json/feature-config.json/bug-config.json) co-located with the server."
  ],
